Octopus Scanner is a privacy focused, user friendly desktop application for local web accessibility auditing. It receives monthly dependency patches and provides bleeding edge access to the latest accessibility rules and checks from one of the industry's most trusted accessibility engines.

Designed by a Senior Web Accessibility Specialist with extensive hands-on auditing experience and used across countless real-world projects, it combines browser automation with Axe Core-powered auditing to deliver full-domain crawling alongside a wide range of advanced accessibility and quality assurance features. 

Built for designers, developers, and accessibility specialists alike, it helps streamline testing while keeping all scanning local to your machine.

Dive Into Octo-Features
Explore a selection of Octopus Scanner capabilities.

    Hybrid Discovery Modes
    Scale audits from a single page to full domain crawling. Supports sitemap ingestion (XML and Gzipped), targeted URL batching, multi domain discovery and single page application route capture for auditing modern JavaScript sites within a single session.
    No Code User Journeys
    Record and replay complex user flows without writing code. Capture authenticated journeys such as logins and checkouts simply by interacting with the browser, with automated scans triggered throughout the sequence.
    Dynamic Content and Shadow DOM Support
    Automatically detect issues within dynamic interfaces by expanding tabs, accordions and interactive components during the scan process. Includes full Shadow DOM support for auditing encapsulated web components.
    Dark Mode Auditing
    Re scan websites using dark mode emulation to identify accessibility issues introduced by colour scheme changes, including contrast failures traditional scanners often miss.
    Two Phase State Scanning
    Audit both expanded and collapsed component states, then intelligently merge findings using fuzzy de duplication. Ideal for identifying hidden issues within tabs, accordions and disclosure widgets.
    Force Reveal Engine
    Overrides hidden or deferred content techniques including smooth scrolling wrappers and content visibility optimisations to reduce false positives and improve audit coverage on heavily animated websites.
    Adaptive Anti Evasion
    Respond intelligently to WAFs and bot protection systems by adjusting crawl delays, enabling stealth protocols and adapting browser fingerprints in real time.
    Parallel Multi Viewport Scanning
    Scan mobile, tablet and desktop layouts simultaneously for faster responsive auditing. Automatically falls back to sequential scanning when anti bot protections are detected. 

Configuration and Control

    Interactive Setup Wizard
    Quickly configure optimal scan settings through a guided setup experience covering scan size, parallel processing, dark mode coverage and smart deduplication, tailored to speed, depth and compliance requirements including WCAG 2.2, Section 508 and EN 301 549.
    Live Scan Visualiser
    Monitor the live browser in real time to verify navigation, observe DOM changes and debug complex crawls without relying solely on logs. A truthful dashboard tracks pages genuinely audited, pages crawled, duplicates skipped and live network traffic.
    Device and Viewport Emulation
    Emulate popular devices including iPhone and Pixel presets or configure fully custom viewport dimensions for responsive accessibility testing.
    Saved Configurations
    Create reusable scan profiles and import or export configuration files between machines or team members.
    Network and Session Control
    Supports persistent sessions, cookie retention and configurable timeout handling for unstable or authenticated environments.
    Granular Rule Logic
    Customise audits by disabling specific Axe rules or defining exclusive rule allowlists for targeted compliance testing. 

System Stability and Performance

    Smart Deduplication Engine
    Spends the scan budget on genuinely distinct content. Canonical references, content fingerprints, structural template sampling and locale mirror detection prevent the same page being audited dozens of times, and every skipped page is recorded in the report with its reason so nothing disappears silently.
    Analytics Tracker Blocking
    Blocks pure analytics and ad tracking requests at the network layer so pages settle measurably faster, with zero effect on rendered content or audit accuracy.
    Intelligent Trap Avoidance
    Detects and avoids crawler traps such as infinite calendars, duplicate paths, recursive parameters and soft 404 pages to keep scans efficient and focused.
    Adaptive Crawl Delay
    Automatically increases crawl delays when errors or blocking behaviour are detected, then gradually restores speed once stability returns.
    Streaming Report Architecture
    Scan data is offloaded to disk in real time and aggregated live as pages complete, so reports are ready the moment the final page finishes and websites containing thousands of pages scan reliably without size ceilings or memory crashes.
    Parallel Processing Engine
    Accelerates large audits through concurrent browser instances performing discovery and analysis simultaneously.
    Periodic Browser Recovery
    Performs scheduled browser restarts during large crawls to prevent memory drift and improve long term stability.
    Self Healing Watchdog
    Automatically detects unresponsive browser instances, restarts them silently and resumes the scan queue without losing progress.
    Privacy First Architecture
    All scanning, analysis and reporting remain entirely local. No telemetry, URLs, reports or scan data are ever transmitted externally. 

Reporting and Decision Support

    Interactive Review System
    Review, approve or dismiss findings directly within reports. Compliance scores and metrics update dynamically based on manual verification decisions.
    Consolidated Reporting Dashboard
    Generate self contained HTML reports containing automated findings, evidence screenshots, remediation guidance and relevant code snippets, with every issue linked to its official W3C success criterion documentation.
    Dual Format Delivery
    Every scan produces both the interactive HTML report and a complete companion CSV containing every instance untruncated. Very large reports additionally ship with a packaged screenshots download so evidence is always accessible.
    Visual Defect Stamping
    Optionally embed diagnostic data including rule identifiers, HTML snippets and remediation guidance directly onto screenshots, losslessly compressed for lighter reports, for streamlined developer communication.
    Professional Ticket Generation
    Open any finding as a fully structured ticket: description, who the issue affects and why it matters, the linked WCAG criterion, ready to use severity, reproduction steps, scan environment and a per issue export of every affected instance, ready to paste into any tracker.
    PDF Accessibility Auditing
    Perform structural accessibility checks on linked PDF documents to identify untagged or inaccessible files. 

